{"id":"652572","name":"芹菜肉馅包子","author":"宸·羽","authorId":"7796837","desc":"","cover":"images/652572/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"芹菜","amount":"250g"},{"name":"猪肉","amount":"200g"},{"name":"面粉","amount":"500g"}],"sub":[{"name":"酵母粉","amount":"5g"},{"name":"糖","amount":"10g"},{"name":"清水","amount":"250g"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"盆中放入面粉、酵母粉、糖。","img":"images/652572/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"加适量的清水和成面团。","img":"images/652572/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"发酵至两倍大。","img":"images/652572/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"准备肉末。","img":"images/652572/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"芹菜。","img":"images/652572/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"芹菜切碎。","img":"images/652572/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"烧开一锅水，倒入芹菜焯水30秒。","img":"images/652572/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"捞出，过凉水。","img":"images/652572/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"芹菜攥干水分，放入肉馅中。","img":"images/652572/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"放入姜、葱末。","img":"images/652572/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"炝入热油。","img":"images/652572/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"放入盐、蚝油，酱油，胡椒粉拌匀。","img":"images/652572/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"取出发酵好的面，揉搓排气后切成小剂子。","img":"images/652572/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"擀成面皮，包入馅料。","img":"images/652572/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"做成包子。","img":"images/652572/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"再次发酵15分钟，入锅蒸15分钟，焖5分钟后开盖。","img":"images/652572/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/652572/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"成品。好吃！","img":"images/652572/step_18.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：蒸锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}